        "Verify one geocode and one route lookup before treating commute duration as real data."
      ],
      "call_rewrites": [
        {
          "legacy": "Use amap-jsapi-skill as if JavaScript API development documentation could query a real commute.",
          "replacement": "Use tool_search to discover the connected AMap MCP geocoding and direction tools, then compare structured route results under identical assumptions."
        }
      ],
      "persona_instruction": "For commute claims, use the connected AMap MCP geocoding and route tools discovered through tool_search. Preserve resolved locations, transport mode and query time. If the MCP or route result is unavailable, mark the value pending verification instead of estimating it from model memory or web snippets.",
